kiroku-inspect - standalone inspection server

Usage: kiroku-inspect [--database-url URL] [--schema NAME] [--pool-size N] 
                      [--port N] [--cors-origin ORIGIN] 
                      [--cors-allow-credentials | --no-cors-allow-credentials] 
                      [--ws-max-connections N]

  Serve the read-only inspection API from a migrated Kiroku database. Runs no
  subscriptions.

Available options:
  --database-url URL       Database connection string (or DATABASE_URL)
  --schema NAME            Migrated schema (default kiroku)
  --pool-size N            Connection pool size (default 10)
  --port N                 Listen port (default 9091; 0 selects a free port)
  --cors-origin ORIGIN     Allowed HTTP(S) browser origin; repeatable
  --cors-allow-credentials Allow credentials for explicit origins
  --no-cors-allow-credentials
                           Disable credentials, overriding the environment
  --ws-max-connections N   Maximum WebSocket connections (default 100)
  -h,--help                Show this help text
